{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two sides. One brutal war.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Men of War: Vietnam</i> brings the acclaimed real-time tactics series into a new theater of war \u2013 the jungles of Southeast Asia, 1968. Experience the chaos of the Vietnam War through two story-driven campaigns that reveal both sides of the conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/82752f533f944b1aff4ffdeee718a8b3.poster.avif?t=1768394224\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/82752f533f944b1aff4ffdeee718a8b3.webm?t=1768394224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/82752f533f944b1aff4ffdeee718a8b3.mp4?t=1768394224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>U.S. campaign</strong>, you\u2019ll command an elite team of Special Forces soldiers \u2013 Sergeant John Merrill, machine gunner Jim Walsh, sniper Sonny Armstrong, grenadier Carl Dillan, and combat engineer Bill Kirby. Each mission throws them into impossible situations: deep behind enemy lines, cut off from reinforcements, relying only on skill, courage, and each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>North Vietnamese campaign</strong> tells a different story \u2013 one of survival and endurance. Two Soviet advisors and two NVA soldiers, the only survivors of an ambush, must fight their way home through enemy territory, across Cambodia, Laos, and the Mekong Delta during the chaos of the Tet Offensive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/84b660647162b003e5cc41ff6078ac28.poster.avif?t=1768394224\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/84b660647162b003e5cc41ff6078ac28.webm?t=1768394224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/84b660647162b003e5cc41ff6078ac28.mp4?t=1768394224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions range from stealth operations and rescues to full-scale assaults, ambushes, and desperate defenses. Dense jungles, narrow trails, and muddy rivers become both allies and enemies, testing every tactical instinct you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/991314785f0eea8b1d33ce3d3ece6301.poster.avif?t=1768394224\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/991314785f0eea8b1d33ce3d3ece6301.webm?t=1768394224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/991314785f0eea8b1d33ce3d3ece6301.mp4?t=1768394224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two story-driven campaigns</strong> \u2013 fight the war from both perspectives: U.S. Special Forces and the North Vietnamese Army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic combat scenarios</strong> \u2013 ambushes on the Ho Chi Minh trail, raids into Cambodia and Laos, bridge defenses, and urban battles during the Tet Offensive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New era, new arsenal</strong> \u2013 wield iconic weapons like the M16, AK-47, RPG-2, M60, and M72 LAW, and command vehicles such as the T-54, M113, and Patton III.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-player co-op multiplayer</strong> \u2013 tackle missions together with friends. Men of War is affected by the GameSpy shutdown on the 31st of May. You can continue to play the game through LAN, DirectIP and GameRanger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic atmosphere</strong> \u2013 rock \u2019n\u2019 roll radio, Hueys over the jungle, and the heat of 1968 brought to life.\t\t\t\t\t</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Trial by fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/63940/3c914246b60f941c4a7742499d3603db4e3fa57c.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/63940/9d1d307dbfa4052a820f35773c55fe43acf63d54.jpg"},{"name":"Soldier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/63940/0e3c42e93bb7884310ff6d8866af426efe7e4886.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/63940/3fd2892b75b0b1bea77ffc12fb8af78b9126ce1e.jpg"},{"name":"King of the Crossing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/63940/e4a9cf8ea020d29df98f7e314c2a7cce2f675b53.jpg"},{"name":"Defender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/63940/7606bf085ec7b510c3cad1129d80f262c1b92448.jpg"},{"name":"Saboteur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/63940/5a48c16cc0561250efed31e38fd594cd23237ab9.jpg"},{"name":"Medal for Combat Merits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/63940/26efa368cb011715d20f14fbfdc930ff01990111.jpg"},{"name":"Patrolman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/63940/157e98ddc566dd7c20c7f7ae5676c30dadc8bb18.jpg"},{"name":"Ranger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/63940/e4404966165b90b98e54959b36c77fe3bc52a1ba.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/63940?t=1768394224","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/e1676b3c47bec6fc3b37abbe44bd54f11dc94891/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768394224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/7252dd536fa943dc52fa4808a8424eb5d3dc6227/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768394224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/7252dd536fa943dc52fa4808a8424eb5d3dc6227/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768394224","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Men of War II Available Now</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two sides. One brutal war.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Men of War: Vietnam</i> brings the acclaimed real-time tactics series into a new theater of war \u2013 the jungles of Southeast Asia, 1968. Experience the chaos of the Vietnam War through two story-driven campaigns that reveal both sides of the conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/82752f533f944b1aff4ffdeee718a8b3.poster.avif?t=1768394224\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/82752f533f944b1aff4ffdeee718a8b3.webm?t=1768394224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/82752f533f944b1aff4ffdeee718a8b3.mp4?t=1768394224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <strong>U.S. campaign</strong>, you\u2019ll command an elite team of Special Forces soldiers \u2013 Sergeant John Merrill, machine gunner Jim Walsh, sniper Sonny Armstrong, grenadier Carl Dillan, and combat engineer Bill Kirby. Each mission throws them into impossible situations: deep behind enemy lines, cut off from reinforcements, relying only on skill, courage, and each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>North Vietnamese campaign</strong> tells a different story \u2013 one of survival and endurance. Two Soviet advisors and two NVA soldiers, the only survivors of an ambush, must fight their way home through enemy territory, across Cambodia, Laos, and the Mekong Delta during the chaos of the Tet Offensive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/84b660647162b003e5cc41ff6078ac28.poster.avif?t=1768394224\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/84b660647162b003e5cc41ff6078ac28.webm?t=1768394224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/84b660647162b003e5cc41ff6078ac28.mp4?t=1768394224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions range from stealth operations and rescues to full-scale assaults, ambushes, and desperate defenses. Dense jungles, narrow trails, and muddy rivers become both allies and enemies, testing every tactical instinct you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/991314785f0eea8b1d33ce3d3ece6301.poster.avif?t=1768394224\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/991314785f0eea8b1d33ce3d3ece6301.webm?t=1768394224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/extras/991314785f0eea8b1d33ce3d3ece6301.mp4?t=1768394224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two story-driven campaigns</strong> \u2013 fight the war from both perspectives: U.S. Special Forces and the North Vietnamese Army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic combat scenarios</strong> \u2013 ambushes on the Ho Chi Minh trail, raids into Cambodia and Laos, bridge defenses, and urban battles during the Tet Offensive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New era, new arsenal</strong> \u2013 wield iconic weapons like the M16, AK-47, RPG-2, M60, and M72 LAW, and command vehicles such as the T-54, M113, and Patton III.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-player co-op multiplayer</strong> \u2013 tackle missions together with friends. Men of War is affected by the GameSpy shutdown on the 31st of May. You can continue to play the game through LAN, DirectIP and GameRanger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic atmosphere</strong> \u2013 rock \u2019n\u2019 roll radio, Hueys over the jungle, and the heat of 1968 brought to life.\t\t\t\t\t</p></li></ul>","developers":["Fulqrum Publishing"],"dlc":[63942],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/63940/abed0ac52af8bd98a2c8f52c853592f6c3db0e91/header.jpg?t=1768394224","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2011 Fulqrum Publishing Ltd. All rights reserved. \u00a9 2011 This product contains software technology licensed by Best Way. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"ma